package com.sliverzfx.gothicquest

object NewBalanceChapter2Part1 {
    val quests = listOf(
        Quest("CH2-001",2,1,"The Portal's Secret",category="Main Story",giver="Lord Hagen",location="Main Story",prerequisites="Where Are All the Missing People? completed.",summary="Hagen asks you to solve the Water Mages' portal problem before he will send you to the Valley of Mines; accepting starts Chapter 2.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Hagen asks you to solve the Water Mages' portal problem before he will send you to the Valley of Mines; accepting starts Chapter 2. Enter Jharkendar and complete Raven. Return to Hagen afterward to report success."),reward="Key to the Valley of Mines pass and 1,000 XP.",warnings="The merchants' guild route can alter when Valley of Mines access becomes available, but Raven still matters for later Vatras/Eye progression.",searchTags=listOf("the portal's secret","main story","lord hagen")),
        Quest("CH2-002",2,2,"Raven",category="Main Story",giver="Saturas",location="Main Story",prerequisites="The Water Mages completed; access to Jharkendar.",summary="Speak with Saturas in Jharkendar and investigate Raven's bandit camp.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Speak with Saturas in Jharkendar and investigate Raven's bandit camp. Either force your way through or infiltrate using bandit armor and complete the camp-access chain. Reach the mine, arrange for Bloodwyn to come down, kill him, take his head and use it to gain access to the temple. Pursue Raven into the Temple of Adanos and continue through Power of the Spirit Guardians and Halls of Adanos until Raven is defeated and the Jharkendar crisis is resolved."),reward="Major Jharkendar progression, substantial XP and access to Raven's/Adanos quest rewards.",warnings="The infiltration route preserves more dialogue and side content than simply slaughtering the camp. Complete side quests before turning the camp hostile if you want maximum content.",searchTags=listOf("raven","main story","saturas")),
        Quest("CH2-003",2,3,"Access to the Temple",category="Main Story",giver="Temple gate guard",location="Main Story",prerequisites="Raven quest active in the bandit camp.",summary="The guard refuses entry unless Bloodwyn is involved.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("The guard refuses entry unless Bloodwyn is involved. Speak to Scatty and then Garaz in the mine to learn that Bloodwyn is greedy. Clear the minecrawler branch, including the named Flesh Gatherer, then report to Garaz. Bloodwyn comes to the mine; kill him, take his head and show it to the temple guard to gain entry."),reward="Temple access, 500 XP for the head presentation, plus related mine/bandit XP.",warnings="Keep Bloodwyn's head: it can later be shown/turned in for additional quest interactions such as Alive or Dead.",searchTags=listOf("access to the temple","main story","temple gate guard")),
        Quest("CH2-004",2,4,"Power of the Spirit Guardians",category="Main Story",giver="Saturas",location="Main Story",prerequisites="Raven has retreated into the Temple of Adanos.",summary="After seeing Raven disappear into the temple, return to Saturas.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After seeing Raven disappear into the temple, return to Saturas. He sends you to Myxir for a way to question an ancient spirit. Obtain the summoning scroll and go to Quarhodron's tomb near the Hermit's hut. Clear the monsters outside and the undead inside, then use the scroll to summon Quarhodron and speak with him to learn how to pass the temple."),reward="Unlocks Quarhodron's information and the Halls of Adanos route; staged XP.",warnings="Prepare before entering the tomb; it contains several monster groups and undead.",searchTags=listOf("power of the spirit guardians","main story","saturas")),
        Quest("CH2-005",2,5,"Halls of Adanos",category="Main Story",giver="Saturas",location="Main Story",prerequisites="Power of the Spirit Guardians progressed; temple access.",summary="Saturas sends you through the dangerous halls of the Temple of Adanos to reach Raven.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Enter the temple and solve its traps. At the first button room use only the left wall: press far-left, far-right, then center. In the guardian/demon hall use the far-right passage. In the dark floor puzzle, use a torch or Light spell and step only on the white tiles, heading toward the wall rather than the central web. Continue through the temple to Raven."),reward="Allows the confrontation with Raven and advances the Jharkendar main quest.",warnings="The entire right-hand button wall in the opening trap is a death trap.",searchTags=listOf("halls of adanos","main story","quarhodron","saturas")),
        Quest("CH2-006",2,6,"Evidence",category="Main Story",giver="Lord Hagen",location="Main Story",prerequisites="The Portal's Secret completed.",summary="Hagen gives you the pass key and sends you to verify the situation in the Valley of Mines.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Hagen gives you the pass key and sends you to verify the situation in the Valley of Mines. Reach Garond in the castle, using the safe-entry quest/route if necessary. Garond cannot write proof until he knows the ore situation, so complete Miners and Ore by visiting the mining camps and collecting their reports. Return to Garond for the written evidence, then take it back to Hagen."),reward="Main-story XP and the evidence needed for the Eye of Innos chain.",warnings="This is the main Chapter 2 bridge into Chapter 3; finish any Chapter 2-only side quests before handing in the final proof if they have chapter limits.",searchTags=listOf("evidence","main story","lord hagen")),
        Quest("CH2-007",2,7,"Miners and Ore",category="Main Story",giver="Garond",location="Main Story",prerequisites="Evidence active; reach the Valley of Mines castle.",summary="Garond gives you a map and asks for the status of the ore expeditions.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Garond gives you a map and asks for the status of the ore expeditions. Visit the mining groups led by Silvestro, Marcos and Fajeth, resolve the local problems needed to obtain each report, then return to Garond with the information so he can prepare the evidence for Lord Hagen."),reward="Progresses Evidence and awards XP for each report and final turn-in.",warnings="Explore each camp thoroughly; several Valley of Mines side quests are tied to the miners and may become unavailable later.",searchTags=listOf("miners and ore","main story","garond")),
        Quest("CH2-008",2,8,"The Man with the Ring",category="Xardas's Tower",giver="Xardas",location="Xardas's Tower",prerequisites="Reach Greg's hut in Jharkendar and speak with Xardas.",summary="Xardas wants Greg's ring after you enter the pirate captain's hut.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After visiting Greg's hut, speak to Xardas about Greg's ring.","Ask Greg for the ring; he says he cannot remove it.","Return to Xardas, who explains that the curse can be broken by defeating an undead captain.","Go to the cave on Jharkendar's southern beach and defeat Captain Drake.","Return to Greg for the ring, then deliver it to Xardas."),reward="100 XP for asking Greg, 300 XP for his story, 500 XP from Xardas, 800 XP on recovering the ring, then 1,500 XP and a Black Mist potion from Xardas.",warnings="Do not equip Greg's cursed ring: it causes possession. Drake can be defeated before accepting the quest.",searchTags=listOf("the man with the ring","xardas's tower","local quest giver in xardas's tower","xardas")),
        Quest("CH2-009",2,9,"Oswald's Farm",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver="Lares / Khorinis notice board",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete earlier quests in the same area/faction if the dialogue is not yet available.",summary="Discover the coastal lands and Oswald's Farm by following the new Chapter 2 notice.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After Chapter 2 begins, read the notice posted on the craftsmen's quarter notice board in Khorinis.","Lares may also approach you and tell you about the same opportunity.","Find the entrance to the new coastal lands behind Onar's farm, heading toward Fregyal's cave.","Reach Oswald's Farm and speak with the innkeeper Jacob to complete the introductory quest; then investigate the area's other quests."),reward="100 XP if Lares gives the lead, then 200 XP for speaking with innkeeper Jacob at Oswald's Farm and completing the quest.",warnings="The initial lead can come from the notice board rather than a conventional NPC conversation.",searchTags=listOf("oswald's farm","khorinis - harbor district","local quest giver in khorinis - harbor district","lares / khorinis notice board")),
        Quest("CH2-010",2,10,"Ragnar's Bandits",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver="Ragnar",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Chapter 3 (not Chapter 2); give Ragnar 100 gold during Hungry Convict in Chapter 1.",summary="Help Ragnar clear the bandits at the cemetery near Khorinis's southern gate.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Find Ragnar in the harbor warehouse; he has become a city guard.","Learn that Lord Andre ordered him to eliminate the bandits near the southern gate.","Go to the cemetery near Khorinis's southern gate, defeat the bandits, loot the note from a corpse, and give it to Ragnar."),reward="700 XP for delivering the bandit's note to Ragnar; choose a knight's blade, 50 crossbow bolts, or an iron helmet.",warnings="This quest belongs to Act/Chapter 3 in the April 2026 New Balance guide, despite its current Chapter 2 archive placement.",searchTags=listOf("ragnar's bandits","khorinis - harbor district","local quest giver in khorinis - harbor district","ragnar")),
        Quest("CH2-011",2,11,"Dangerous Experiment",category="Khorinis - Marketplace",giver="Daron",location="Khorinis - Marketplace",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete earlier quests in the same area/faction if the dialogue is not yet available.",summary="Test Daron's mysterious ring and report the results.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Speak with the Fire Mage Daron and accept the ring-test assignment.","Put on the ring; it teleports you to the Sun Circle.","Return to Daron and describe what happened."),reward="500 XP when the ring teleports you to the Sun Circle; 1,000 XP, three Healing Elixirs and permanent ownership of the ring when you report to Daron.",warnings="The ring transports you to the Sun Circle, potentially into hostile creatures. Prepare before equipping it.",searchTags=listOf("dangerous experiment","khorinis - marketplace","local quest giver in khorinis - marketplace","daron")),
        Quest("CH2-012",2,12,"Mysterious Murder",category="Khorinis - Marketplace",giver="Lord Andre",location="Khorinis - Marketplace",prerequisites="Chapter 2 or later; finish Constantino's special poison assignment and Karras's related task, then wait several days for Lord Andre's murder investigation.",summary="Investigate Ignaz's murder, trace the poisoned vial to Ortega, and decide what to tell Lord Andre.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After completing the poison and Karras quests, wait several in-game days until Lord Andre approaches you about the murdered alchemist Ignaz.","Question Zuris and search behind the fence at Ignaz's house for an empty poison vial.","Show the vial to Constantino and agree to investigate; optionally ask Kardif and Coragon for more clues.","Ask Mika near Khorinis's eastern gate, then visit the cave to the left of the gate.","Confront Ortega, defeat him and read the note on his body.","Wait for the actual instigator, Fire Mage Karras, then speak with him to learn his motive.","Return to Lord Andre and decide how to report the murder."),reward="Closes Ignaz's murder investigation with Lord Andre; dialogue and rewards depend on whether you expose or protect Karras.",warnings="Exposing Karras versus withholding his involvement changes the outcome. Investigate fully before reporting to Lord Andre.",searchTags=listOf("mysterious murder","khorinis - marketplace","local quest giver in khorinis - marketplace","lord andre","ignaz","karras","ortega")),
        Quest("CH2-013",2,13,"Constantino's Strange Request",category="Khorinis - Craftsmen's Quarter",giver = "Constantino",location="Khorinis - Craftsmen's Quarter",prerequisites="Chapter 2. Consider completing Ignaz's Experiment and Field Predator before this quest triggers subsequent events.",summary="Fetch a special bloodfly-stinger poison sample for Constantino; ordinary crafted poison will not satisfy him.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Ask Constantino in Chapter 2 about his unusual alchemical request.","Obtain the quest-specific bloodfly poison either from Fregyal or Baal Tyon for 1,000 gold, or from the wine cave in the eastern forest.","For the wine cave route, get Mole Rat Fat from Martin or Zuris, another quest, or the hold of the paladins' ship.","Use the fat to open the cave grate, defeat the named goblin Mirbl and pick the chest holding the poison.","Return the specific poison sample to Constantino."),reward="1,000 XP and 250 gold from Constantino.",warnings="Ordinary crafted poison will not work. This chain can eventually lead to Ignaz's death, so buy any needed Oblivion scrolls in advance. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/strannaja-prosba-konstantino.66847/",searchTags=listOf("constantino's strange request","khorinis - craftsmen's quarter","local quest giver in khorinis - craftsmen's quarter")),
        Quest("CH2-014",2,14,"Strange Merchant",category="Khorinis - Craftsmen's Quarter",giver="Thorben",location="Khorinis - Craftsmen's Quarter",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete earlier quests in the same area/faction if the dialogue is not yet available.",summary="Find Thorben's missing niece Gritta and return her safely to Khorinis.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Talk to Thorben about Gritta's disappearance.","Either pay Thorben 500 gold, or investigate the bandit encampment in the forest visited during Bartok's hunt.","Defeat the bandits at the forest camp and find Gritta in a tent.","Escort her to the city gate and return to Thorben to finish the quest."),reward="Pay 500 gold: 500 XP and 20 lockpicks, plus 100 XP the following day. Rescue Gritta yourself: 100 XP when you find her, 1,500 XP at the city gate, 300 XP from Thorben and +1 Dexterity.",warnings="The 500-gold payment and direct-rescue routes have different outcomes; the +1 Dexterity is awarded for returning Gritta personally.",searchTags=listOf("strange merchant","khorinis - craftsmen's quarter","local quest giver in khorinis - craftsmen's quarter","thorben")),
        Quest("CH2-015",2,15,"Information for Salandril",category="Khorinis - Upper Quarter",giver = "Salandril",location="Khorinis - Upper Quarter",prerequisites="Chapter 2; speak to Salandril in the Upper Quarter and follow his requested information trail.",summary="Tell Salandril what you learned about the situation in the Valley of Mines.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Start Lord Hagen's Proof mission and, before turning it in, ask Salandril what information he needs.","Travel to the Valley of Mines and complete Garond's ore-mining reconnaissance.","Return to Khorinis and report the miners' situation to Salandril.","Collect his thanks before finishing the overarching Proof objective."),reward="Completes Salandril's information request; exact XP and payment not verified.",warnings="Speak to Salandril before attempting to finish his request; its dialogue may depend on other quests in the Upper Quarter.",searchTags=listOf("information for salandril","khorinis - upper quarter","local quest giver in khorinis - upper quarter")),
        Quest("CH2-016",2,16,"An Assignment from the Ring of Water",category="Vatras",giver = "Vatras",location="Vatras",prerequisites="Reach Chapter 2 and speak with Vatras.",summary="Track an injured white shadowbeast from the Dead Harpy tavern toward the Water Mages' excavation.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Talk to Vatras about work for the Ring of Water in Chapter 2.","Visit Orlan at the Dead Harpy tavern; he describes a violent animal attack under the nearby bridge.","Search under the bridge for a torn strip of hide, then return to Orlan.","Ask Bosper or Falk to identify the hide; it belongs to a rare white shadowbeast.","Follow the white fur tufts by the Innos shrine on the monastery path and onward toward the Water Mages' excavation.","Defeat the wounded white shadowbeast, then report first to Orlan and afterwards to Vatras."),reward="Orlan: 500 XP and 150 gold after the hunt; Vatras: 300 XP for the final report. Intermediate investigation and the white shadowbeast grant additional XP.",warnings="Follow the quest sequence before attempting to complete this objective. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/poruchenie-kolca-vody.66765/",searchTags=listOf("an assignment from the ring of water","vatras","local quest giver in vatras")),
        Quest("CH2-017",2,17,"Vatras's Assignment",category="Vatras",giver = "Vatras",location="Vatras",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete An Assignment from the Ring of Water.",summary="Recover a stolen purse from the bandits near the Water Mages' excavation and return it to Vatras.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After completing An Assignment from the Ring of Water, return to Vatras for his next request.","He explains that bandits attacked a Ring of Water member near the excavation.","Go to the excavation entrance and defeat the two bandits.","Loot the stolen purse from their bodies and return it to Vatras."),reward="500 XP and 300 gold.",warnings="Follow the quest sequence before attempting to complete this objective. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/poruchenie-vatrasa.66766/",searchTags=listOf("vatras's assignment","vatras","local quest giver in vatras")),
        Quest("CH2-018",2,18,"Message for Isgaroth",category="Vatras",giver = "Vatras",location="Vatras",prerequisites="Chapter 2.",summary="Deliver Vatras's sealed letter to Isgaroth near the monastery, then return for a reward.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("In Chapter 2, speak with Vatras and accept his letter for Isgaroth.","Follow the path to the monastery and find Isgaroth at the shrine.","Hand him Vatras's letter without reading it.","Return to Vatras and report the delivery."),reward="250 XP from Vatras, plus choice of 35 magic ore, a steel emerald ring or a King's Sorrel. If the letter remains unread: 200 XP and 2 Healing Extracts from Isgaroth.",warnings="Do not read the letter if you want Isgaroth's bonus items. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/poslanie-dlja-isgarota.66797/",searchTags=listOf("message for isgaroth","vatras","local quest giver in vatras")),
        Quest("CH2-019",2,19,"Letter for Lee",category="Vatras",giver="Vatras",location="Vatras",prerequisites="Chapter 2.",summary="Deliver Vatras's letter to Lee at Onar's farm and unlock Lee's cold-resistance training.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Speak to Vatras in Chapter 2 and take his letter for Lee.","Travel to Onar's farm and speak to Lee in the mercenaries' main building.","Give Lee the letter; he can now teach cold resistance.","Return to Vatras and report the completed delivery."),reward="200 XP for delivering the letter to Lee, plus 250 XP and 200 gold from Vatras; unlocks cold-resistance training with Lee.",warnings="Check relevant prerequisites and dialogue flags. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/pismo-dlja-li.66798/",searchTags=listOf("letter for lee","vatras","local quest giver in vatras")),
        Quest("CH2-020",2,20,"Field Predator",category="Akil's Farm",giver="Akil",location="Akil's Farm",prerequisites="Chapter 2; speak with Akil about the field predator. Consider finishing his quest before Constantino's poison chain.",summary="Investigate the oversized field beast and the pest-control mixture connected to Akil.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Talk to Akil after killing the unusually large field beast; he tells you about a pest-control agent bought from Avanis.","Speak to Avanis at Orlan's tavern, then question Ignaz.","When Ignaz will not cooperate, leave his house and find the note behind the fence.","Read the note and confront Ignaz again.","Choose whether to reveal Avanis's theft of the vial; telling Ignaz the truth gives the better reward when you report to Akil."),reward="Complete the investigation of the field predator threatening Akil's land; exact XP reward not verified.",warnings="The quest can be affected by the Constantino/Karras poison investigation. Complete Akil's request first if you want to preserve it.",searchTags=listOf("field predator","akil's farm","local quest giver in akil's farm","akil")),
